description.2:
{Advanced Poison}

Poisons an enemy unit, reducing its health at once and then at the beginning of the next two rounds.

Effect is greater than that of Basic Poison.

description.3:
{Expert Poison}

Poisons an enemy unit, reducing its health at once and then at the beginning of the next two rounds.

Effect is greater than that of Advanced Poison.

description.2:
{Advanced Disease}

Makes the enemy unit suffer from dreadful illness, reducing its attack, defense and speed.

Effect is twice that of Basic Disease.

description.3:
{Expert Disease}

Makes all the enemy units suffer from dreadful illness, reducing their attack, defense and speed.

Effect is twice that of Basic Disease.

description.2:
{Advanced Age}

Magically ages the enemy unit, reducing its health.

Effect is greater than that of Basic Age.

description.3:
{Expert Age}

Magically ages the enemy unit, reducing its health.

Effect is greater than that of Advanced Age.

description.1:
{Basic Fear}

Strikes an enemy unit with such fear that it becomes unable to attack and nearly unable to move.

Spell Point cost is half that of Normal Fear.

description.2:
{Advanced Fear}

Strikes an enemy unit with such fear that it becomes unable to attack and nearly unable to move.

Penalty to movement is twice that of Basic Fear.

description.3:
{Expert Fear}

Strikes an enemy unit with such fear that it becomes unable to attack and nearly unable to move.

Penalty to movement is three times that of Basic Fear.

description.2:
{Advanced Death Cloud}

Causes a deadly cloud to cover the selected target and any adjacent units.

Damage inflicted is 30 points more than Basic Death Cloud.

description.3:
{Expert Death Cloud}

Causes a deadly cloud to cover the selected target and any adjacent units.

Damage inflicted is 90 points more than Basic Death Cloud.

description.2:
{Advanced Drain Life}

Gives the selected unit the ability to drain life from enemies, allowing to restore its health and even to resurrect fallen allies.

Effect is greater than that of Basic Drain Life.

description.3:
{Expert Drain Life}

Gives the selected unit the ability to drain life from enemies, allowing to restore its health and even to resurrect fallen allies.

Effect is greater than that of Advanced Drain Life.

description.2:
{Advanced Summon Sprite}

Allows you to summon sprites.

Summons approximately one-and-a-half times the number of units as Basic Summon Sprite.

description.3:
{Expert Summon Sprite}

Allows you to summon sprites.

Summons approximately twice the number of units as Basic Summon Sprite.

description.2:
{Advanced Summon Magic Elemental}

Allows you to summon magic elementals.  Once cast, no other elemental types may be summoned.

Summons approximately one-and-a-half times the number of units as Basic Summon Magic Elemental.

description.3:
{Expert Summon Magic Elemental}

Allows you to summon magic elementals.  Once cast, no other elemental types may be summoned.

Summons approximately twice the number of units as Basic Summon Magic Elemental.

description.2:
{Advanced Summon Firebird}

Allows you to summon firebirds.

Summons approximately one-and-a-half times the number of units as Basic Summon Firebird.

description.3:
{Expert Summon Firebird}

Allows you to summon firebirds.

Summons approximately twice the number of units as Basic Summon Firebird.

description.2:
{Advanced Toughness}

Makes the selected unit healthy, like a child who ate a lot of porridge.

Effect is one spoon of porridge more than that of Basic Toughness.

description.3:
{Expert Toughness}

Makes the selected unit healthy, like a child who ate a lot of porridge.

Effect is two spoons of porridge more than that of Basic Toughness.

description.2:
{Advanced Behemoth's Claws}

Makes a friendly unit's attacks as fierce as Behemoth's.

Effect is twice that of Basic Behemoth's Claws.

description.3:
{Expert Behemoth's Claws}

Makes a friendly unit's attacks as fierce as Behemoth's.

Effect is four times that of Basic Behemoth's Claws.

description.2:
{Advanced Incineration}

Engulfs the selected target and any adjacent units in blazing flames.

Damage inflicted is 50 points more than Basic Incineration.

description.3:
{Expert Incineration}

Engulfs the selected target and any adjacent units in blazing flames.

Damage inflicted is 150 points more than Basic Incineration.

description.2:
{Advanced Explosion}

Just explodes the selected unit. Poof!

Damage inflicted is 25 points more than Basic Explosion.

description.3:
{Expert Explosion}

Just explodes the selected unit. Poof!

Damage inflicted is 75 points more than Basic Explosion.
